{
  "about": "Example photos: shown on the page (demo: true) and used as test cases for mask.js (see tests/). Checkpoints are [x, y] in 0-1 image coordinates: with the default settings, 'keep' points must end up opaque and 'remove' points transparent. A checkpoint with 'known' (the reason) is a current failure that's tracked rather than treated as a test failure.",
